{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "083c0e233cd26d7aad75efdfd48ee96370fc03a9cadb562e622eee4953f1e3df", "ja": "レッスン中、集中できていない様子の朋花。\nメンバーが理由を尋ねると、将来有望なアス\nリートである後輩から熱のこもった手紙を貰\nい、返事に困っていると語る。プロデューサ\nーの助言もあり、朋花は筆を執るのだった。", "zh": "练习中，朋花看起来有些无法集中精神。\n成员们询问原因后，她说自己收到了一封来自未来可期的运动健将后辈的热情洋溢的信，正为该怎么回信而烦恼。\n在制作人的建议下，朋花提笔写起了回信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "360b4e32788ba8f14c496548d6613c4df33ae21822ec71dac84f3e56d29e5999", "ja": "（引き続きレッスンも仕事も順調！\n……なんだけど、朋花の様子が気になるな……）", "zh": "（接下来课程和工作也都很顺利！……不过，总觉得朋花的样子有些奇怪……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "97c66310d4bbe865b45702f00172c20e09c21b6f332e897a17c96b067b7498a6", "ja": "あの、朋花ちゃん。\nもしかして、悩みごととかあるのかな……？", "zh": "那个，朋花。\n该不会是有什么烦恼吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "5451a83776e44d3278de4f863e83dd8fc0b4ae41faced1cd605b1e4187043211", "ja": "？　悩みごと、ですか～……？", "zh": "？烦恼吗～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "4e1f6f71a88cc6c90288dc94eb819ab87a5c008dc4909a7d951b6e27a7c49ed6", "ja": "うん。私の勘違いだったらごめんなさいだけど……\n朋花ちゃんにしては、珍しく集中力がないっていうか。", "zh": "嗯。要是我误会了就对不起了，不过……\n对朋花来说，难得有点无法集中精神，或者说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "dcbb5d6722eedee6bf67fb9b68a0d261ec232bc23a5133a51ddeb54c0158246a", "ja": "言われてみれば……今日の朋花さん、\n物思いにふけっていることが多いような……？", "zh": "这么一说……今天的朋花小姐，好像确实经常在沉思呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "37c7883ab2995f0247e2ac6d67d9c72cdcd307a22a973b8c0e92cabfe382b960", "ja": "そういえば朋花さん、\nおやつもちょっとしか食べてないです！", "zh": "这么一说来，朋花小姐今天好像也没怎么吃零食！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "f8faeb85ae0574882f65f9aa0593e7cec24f99e8d1e8ab0e6a7cb2781db4d3eb", "ja": "あの、もしお腹すいてて元気が出ないなら、\n私が持ち帰ろうと思ってたおやつを……！", "zh": "那个，要是肚子饿了没力气的话，\n我本来打算带回家的点心就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "221d8db3145a9f5fb896caabda88d4ccc08cadad6efa551cfe1dd5408fb092cb", "ja": "ふふっ、大丈夫ですよ～。\n……みなさんに、心配をかけてはいけませんね～。", "zh": "呵呵，没关系哦～  \n……不能让大家担心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "36fe4a22abf87b82efdf11afc3240f4b6b4637d82dea95913e57c1d22d17f079", "ja": "{$P$}さん。レッスンの後、\nすこしだけ私に時間をもらえませんか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。练习结束之后，\n能稍微借给我一点时间吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "67645e84d05b1041c45f8089e78a66f709142becc4a92b4e90df4ba072060a49", "ja": "ああ、わかった。", "zh": "啊，我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "3dc0428b4bfaae0cc01400c3608b12ca99d84be7e11f595cb528a9e85c7a21c0", "ja": "『注目の若手アスリート！　記録を次々に\n塗り替え、これからの女子陸上を背負う逸材……』", "zh": "“备受瞩目的年轻运动员！不断刷新纪录，是肩负女子田径未来的奇才……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "659b3dc22643e474702071ac2bb4ce661d7240faf27c8c46ee151d17f4aa6705", "ja": "す、すごい……スポーツ漫画に出てくる天才が、\nそのまま三次元に飛び出してきたような人ですね……。", "zh": "好、好厉害……简直就像运动漫画里的天才直接跳到三次元来了一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "08a52113c35473340421713d8740426fec591de9add9bac9680c35d93ca49562", "ja": "しかも、私と朋花さん、\n百合子さんと同じ中学生です！", "zh": "而且，我和朋花，还有百合子，都是初中生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "e8b674e75c21174a567a91bb6e20222337c3ee6dc36956410e97d9bc6635a74c", "ja": "前に、お仕事で棋士さんやモデルさんに会いましたけど\n……スポーツにも、すごい人がいるんですね！", "zh": "之前因为工作，我见过棋士和模特……\n……没想到体育界也有这么厉害的人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "eee6afc036510cf97f7373def9e49cb6eb0eb626664d3559ff3f73d397ce13bc", "ja": "次世代のスターというやつだな。……あれ？　\nよく見たらこの子、朋花と同じ中学じゃないか？", "zh": "这就是所谓的次世代明星吧。……咦？  \n仔细一看，这孩子不是和朋花上同一所初中吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "9f632a520382862592636a4579bcb5053a190c7d401f8372f5a267c9480d4cde", "ja": "はい、後輩になります～。実は……つい先日、\n彼女から、とても熱のこもった手紙を貰いまして……。", "zh": "是的，她是我的学妹～其实……就在前几天，\n她还给我寄来了一封饱含热情的信……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "daa74e56ef4c5ecb234ab3dac76a50be7654a8f27d2f58a2ece37c388dd716e6", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。それじゃあ、\n朋花ちゃんが悩んでいたのって……。", "zh": "原来是这样……那么，朋花烦恼的就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "b9d49c38bca2074e6f26d09fc78b116f63e10efa6822f279e1e39a3417f9cbab", "ja": "はい、返事をどうしようか迷っていて……\n集中力を欠いていたなら、原因はこれかと～。", "zh": "是的，我正在犹豫该怎么回复……要是说我注意力不集中，原因大概就是这个吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1fa7817c52d8980a5eebc48a5385500b627aefdcd45d0eff95353c4c6acd0c4e", "ja": "プロデューサーとしては中身が気になるけど……\n学校でもらったなら、プライベートな手紙だしな……。", "zh": "作为制作人，我确实有点在意里面写了什么，不过……既然是在学校收到的，毕竟是私人信件……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "c97a7f2c3226e76341a0b3aae37c352bcd3fa0197753d63328800b5f081e3d5b", "ja": "そうですね～。プライバシーを考えて、中身は\n私だけが知っている方がいいと思います～。", "zh": "是这样呢～。考虑到隐私，我觉得还是只有我知道里面的内容比较好～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "9f4b9a49d6b687320a79b48315a4d9afe80e0897554fe528605b6a3399ed99d1", "ja": "変な内容だったら、{$P$}さんに\nとっくに相談してるはずだもんね……。", "zh": "要是内容很奇怪的话，肯定早就找{$P$}先生商量了才对呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "1d2fce5df0fe9fa161cc49995795ba59fc5b418500882ca3b2b9178d73263087", "ja": "うん……。その後輩ちゃんの事を考えたら、\n朋花ちゃんだけが知ってる方がいいと思う。", "zh": "嗯……。考虑到那位后辈，我觉得还是只让朋花知道比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "12db1142d36d534637e8ac3ac058329262e191e870d998e441208e06371ddde0", "ja": "でも、そんなすごい人が送る、熱のこもった手紙って\nどんなだろう……？　うう、いけないいけない！", "zh": "不过，那样厉害的人寄来的、饱含热情的信，会是什么样呢……？呜，不行不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "d07972230faa71ddd8ba698d0fcda3188885aebf32d4eba491b5ace4bcdd4606", "ja": "朋花さん。せっかく相談してくれたのに、\n力になれなくてごめんなさい……。", "zh": "朋花。你特地来找我商量，我却帮不上什么忙，真的很抱歉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "81c658fced66e9681109e3386bb41f99dbcf549b7b18643ef65d58e370ca2ff8", "ja": "いいんですよ～。お話が出来て、\n私も頭の整理になりましたから～。", "zh": "没关系啦～能和您聊聊，也让我理清了思绪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "97243ef192b0cb8e9dec387c3f3877eaf31393903a159d5da9184b1ce15160ff", "ja": "（朋花がああ言う以上、強引なことは出来ないな……。\nただ一点、気になることがあるけど……）", "zh": "（既然朋花都那么说了……看来不能强硬行事了。\n不过，还是有一点让我很在意……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1027_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "f288f1cb11a8aa8a33abd2c3317bb8b7a1ecee9be4a481bf3c6c3ef5c7803726", "ja": "あら？　{$P$}さん、\nまだ帰っていなかったんですか～？", "zh": "哎呀？{$P$}先生，\n您还没回去吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "7eba58c392723e561e72ac903f3903c2a39ba0cccb4f74204a6d5a53db554cbb", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま。朋花が昼間話していた手紙の\nことを、もう少しだけ聞いておこうと思って……。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。我想再问问白天朋花提到的那封信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "bf2e83d37e92cc57b8dc8640c6a8fe7dd3e700d100827af9dd64e6d2d48c25d9", "ja": "そのことですか～。手紙の内容については、\n話す気はないと言ったはずですよ～？", "zh": "是那件事吗～？我应该说过，我不打算谈信里的内容吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "0724607bb7498ba677c81a12cef59d77cf146549d0c312190e73172f4d5c8c7b", "ja": "うん、プライベートなものだからな。\nでも手紙の内容以外の話なら、聞けるかもと思って。", "zh": "嗯，毕竟是私人的东西。\n不过我想，或许可以听听信件内容以外的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1032_031tom", "source_sha256": "340c6f914735286e6a17b776642d3e4edf00fa3e01a8746e81002b07012466f2", "ja": "内容以外……？", "zh": "信的内容以外……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "90fe474d893a8b115d3cf621c728d961ea756406b271e9c404e5d589199fe881", "ja": "朋花は今までにも、いろんな人から\nそういう手紙を受け取ってきたんだろう？", "zh": "朋花之前也收到过很多人写来的\n这类信件吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "2165245e11d41bcac4ece09708eaa02261152340bc29194e6a442b71d6ca774f", "ja": "だから、内容以外で気にしている点があるなら、\nその話は聞くことが出来るかなと思って。", "zh": "所以，如果你在意的不是内容本身，而是其他方面，我想或许可以听你说说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "95c7bb394868cf5271202105f3ce51b1179bde2b406d530dbffb6ce379ead027", "ja": "ふふっ……そうですね～。踏み込みすぎない、\n従者としていい視点だと褒めてあげましょう～。", "zh": "呵呵……确实如此～那我就夸奖你一下吧，你保持着不过分僭越、作为随从来说很不错的视角～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1036_031tom", "source_sha256": "664824c3a46333da6d1389ed007ee09bb97ed30c790546da3d0b5093536aba7a", "ja": "もちろん、どんな内容の手紙を受け取ろうと、\n聖母の心が揺らぐことはありませんが……。", "zh": "当然，无论收到内容如何的信，圣母的心都不会动摇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1037_031tom", "source_sha256": "7eb5a24ba7f7c5871bedb021d33d8fbeeebc47472e23f5bd605d9baf7b6926aa", "ja": "今回、私が戸惑っているとしたら……\n自身の至らなさに対して、ですね～。", "zh": "这次，如果说我有什么困惑的话……是因为意识到自己的不足吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "1aa3c272e037207a05b3b3950e2c8517ec2366e21970b42e9832cdec3aa3eb60", "ja": "自身の至らなさ……？", "zh": "自己的不足……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1039_031tom", "source_sha256": "fe6677855212615b1969ba5277bf2b1c1ded40a75725dfe62ed35eff8737b4ad", "ja": "私は、自分の学校の子豚ちゃん達は、全て把握している\nつもりだったんです～。……手紙の彼女以外は……。", "zh": "我原以为，自己学校里的小猪们，我全都了解～。……除了写信的那位以外……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1040_031tom", "source_sha256": "4c48170389e27568de043fae716ad3f96815caee3e8049db248afaed60bc2ab1", "ja": "まさか同じ学校の後輩……隣人に、\n聖母の愛を届け損ねていたなんて……。", "zh": "没想到竟然没能将圣母的爱\n传递给同校的学妹……也就是我的邻人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "d209cad44c91e319d13b09abc7c2a42e3546ea5dfd1ae7dbdb3f4f65d8b953d6", "ja": "でも、その割にはよく知っている\nみたいじゃないか。その後輩のこと。", "zh": "不过照你这说法，你好像很了解那位后辈嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1042_031tom", "source_sha256": "d78d2702d639ad7a8c9fdc197ba62279dbd041cc8ed790775a56a6be786ad3c7", "ja": "有名人ですから～。だからこそ……頭の中で、\n勝手に区分けをしていたのかもしれません～。", "zh": "毕竟是名人嘛～。也正因为如此……我可能在脑子里，\n不自觉地把她归了类～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1043_031tom", "source_sha256": "d370429cb273dd779cd87a367f62fe7e89b0fb6fb1a9be7789aa14b686a78f2e", "ja": "彼女も手紙をもらう側。他者から崇拝され、\n見上げられる存在だと……。", "zh": "觉得她也是收信的一方。是受人崇拜、\n被人仰望的存在……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1044_031tom", "source_sha256": "451f5ab7206d2d02f45c9212edf20865998e59c9b4863182f78f6ca151986d5a", "ja": "聖母の役目を果たせず、愛を届け損なっていたのに……\n彼女にどんな言葉を送ればいいのかと……。", "zh": "明明没能履行圣母的职责，没能传递爱意……我该对她说些什么才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "9744f345e5090a05efdf436c70bc995ae97f2c6d4cf727b274689520933d779c", "ja": "なるほどな……でも、聖母の愛を\n届け損ねていたっていうのは、違うと思うな。", "zh": "原来如此……不过，说你没能传达圣母的爱，我觉得不太对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1046_p", "source_sha256": "154635939fd8cc515333a4d833a1fa598a99bcacd5bc69d0950690ffd8cbb60f", "ja": "だって、その後輩にも愛は届いていたはずだから。\nだからこそ彼女は、今回手紙をくれたんだろう？", "zh": "因为，那位后辈应该也感受到了你的爱。\n正因为如此，她这次才会给你写信吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "1e3b2a77d11e2736bcc1cef80b5255dd8ec307eaf553466a87cb97cea592763a", "ja": "朋花がその子にどうしてあげたいかだけで、\nいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "只要想想朋花自己想为那个孩子做什么，\n就够了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1049_p", "source_sha256": "8cfd729cb979339e7081b81d2ead913000ccb658220e1e3cfecc835c6d8d3f68", "ja": "相手が誰であっても、聖母の愛は変わらない。なら、\n今回の返事も難しく考えることはないと思うけど。", "zh": "不管对方是谁，圣母的爱都不会改变。所以，我觉得这次也不用想得太复杂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1050_031tom", "source_sha256": "e8a5349ffbaad04b4d6af4c89d1d16c3249c1c14f927d4d27ccdb79cc0ad4403", "ja": "……。\n知った風な口を利きますね～。", "zh": "……真是说得一副很懂的样子呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1051_031tom", "source_sha256": "538a6c68622c6baf5cf9a90e5ffebb998d79cb12b30c50f7157ea365fe546a1a", "ja": "そこまで言うのなら、{$P$}さんには\n……返信の内容、一緒に考えてもらいますよ～？", "zh": "既然您都这么说了，那就请您也一起帮忙想想\n……该怎么回复{$P$}先生吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1052_p", "source_sha256": "564778fbf8ee29294274a837b8ce0e3c6505cf9e338584ab79146f876c0420f3", "ja": "それは構わないけど……。でも、手紙の内容は\n読ませてくれないんだよな？", "zh": "那倒没问题……不过，你不会让我读信的内容吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_05_1053_031tom", "source_sha256": "7e31d7fde9f7ce0f660df1fd1f415f52783bcd508d6868a17cf2fe3f42ef8d21", "ja": "ふふっ、当然です～。私のプロデューサーなら、\nそれくらいはこなしてもらいますよ～♪", "zh": "呵呵，当然啦～。既然是我的制作人，这点小事还是要做到的哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
